0011_platform_upgrade has been applied to a database that matters (the Railway
production service, first boot of the deploy that added this file). From here
on it is immutable: scripts/regen-migration.sh refuses to regenerate it, and
every schema change is appended as 0012+ with

    pnpm --filter @constructos/db generate --name <what_changed>

A regenerated 0011 gets a new journal timestamp, the migrator at boot treats
it as unapplied, and the deploy dies re-creating tables that already exist.
